WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:08.500
Engineers, administrators, managers, and security teams help create the operational reality behind the Trust Services Criteria.

2
00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:19.500
Secure coding, access management, monitoring, incident response, logging, testing, documentation, and change management all contribute to trust.

3
00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:23.060
The criteria are not simply audit concepts.

4
00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:29.480
They represent practical goals that help organizations operate responsibly and build customer confidence.

5
00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:41.360
Leaders can support the criteria by setting priorities, assigning ownership, funding resilient operations, encouraging documentation, and treating secure engineering as part of business trust.
